</ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-10-01to2026-03-31" escape="true" id="Fact000616" name="us-gaap:AccountsAndNontradeReceivableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_806_eus-gaap--AccountsAndNontradeReceivableTextBlock_zAbThaCTtvdh" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0"><b>Note 3 &#8211; <span id="xdx_820_zgBVBppNX8b2">Accounts receivable, net</span></b></p>

